{"id":"9-1-2","courseId":"9","chapterNumber":"1.2","title":"Brøkregning","description":"Multiplikasjon og divisjon med brøker, samt sammensatte uttrykk.","estimatedMinutes":55,"competenceGoals":["utvikle og bruke metodar for hovudrekning, overslagsrekning og skriftleg rekning"],"content":[{"id":"9-1-2-intro","type":"text","content":"## Repetisjon av brøkregning\n\nEn brøk $\\frac{a}{b}$ representerer $a$ delt på $b$, der $a$ er telleren og $b$ er nevneren."},{"id":"9-1-2-def-1","type":"definition","title":"Regneregler for brøker","content":"**Addisjon/Subtraksjon:** Må ha lik nevner\n$$\\frac{a}{c} + \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a+b}{c}$$\n\n**Multiplikasjon:** Gang teller med teller, nevner med nevner\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a \\cdot c}{b \\cdot d}$$\n\n**Divisjon:** Gang med den omvendte brøken\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$$"},{"id":"9-1-2-example-1","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 1","problem":"Regn ut og forkort:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4}$\nb) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8}$\nc) $\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"**Løsning:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 4} = \\frac{10}{12} = \\frac{5}{6}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8} = \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{9} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nc) $\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 3}{6 \\cdot 10} = \\frac{15}{60} = \\frac{1}{4}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{15} = \\frac{2}{5}$","answer":0.4},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4}{7} \\cdot \\frac{14}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{56}{56} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{5}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{3}{5} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2}{9} \\div \\frac{4}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{9} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"}],"solution":"a) 2/5, b) 1, c) 1/2, d) 1/6","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-finnfeil","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-finnfeil-ex","number":"F1","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"**Finn feilen!** Ola har regnet ut $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5}$ slik:\n\n$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2 + 1}{3 + 5} = \\frac{3}{8}$\n\nFinn feilen og skriv riktig utregning.","solution":"Ola har lagt sammen teller og nevner hver for seg, men det er feil. Vi kan bare legge sammen brøker som har lik nevner. Riktig: Fellesnevner er 15. $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 5} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 3} = \\frac{10}{15} + \\frac{3}{15} = \\frac{13}{15}$.","hints":["Vi kan bare legge sammen brøker med lik nevner — finn fellesnevneren først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-example-2","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 2","problem":"Regn ut:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{4}$\nb) $\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{9}$","solution":"**Løsning:**\n\na) Fellesnevner: 12\n   $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{8}{12} + \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{11}{12}$\n\nb) Fellesnevner: 18\n   $\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{9} = \\frac{15}{18} - \\frac{4}{18} = \\frac{11}{18}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{15}{20} + \\frac{8}{20} = \\frac{23}{20}$","answer":1.15},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{21}{24} - \\frac{8}{24} = \\frac{13}{24}$","expressionAnswer":"13/24"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{6} + \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{3}{6} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) 23/20, b) 13/24, c) 1","hints":["Finn fellesnevner først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-text-3","type":"text","content":"## Sammensatte brøkuttrykk\n\nNår vi har brøker i teller eller nevner, løser vi opp ved å gange teller og nevner med samme tall (ofte fellesnevneren)."},{"id":"9-1-2-example-3","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 3","problem":"Forenkle:\n\na) $\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{1}{6}}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2}{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"**Løsning:**\n\na) Først: $\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}$\n\n   Så: $\\frac{\\frac{5}{6}}{\\frac{1}{6}} = \\frac{5}{6} \\div \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{6}{1} = 5$\n\nb) $\\frac{2}{\\frac{3}{4}} = 2 \\div \\frac{3}{4} = 2 \\cdot \\frac{4}{3} = \\frac{8}{3}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Forenkle","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{4}{9}}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{\\frac{6}{5}}$","solution":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{5}{6} = \\frac{5}{2}$","answer":2.5},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}}{\\frac{3}{4}} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) 3/2, b) 5/2, c) 1","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-example-4","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 4","problem":"I en klasse er $\\frac{2}{5}$ av elevene gutter. $\\frac{3}{4}$ av guttene spiller fotball. Hvor stor andel av klassen er gutter som spiller fotball?","solution":"**Løsning:**\n\nAndel = $\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{6}{20} = \\frac{3}{10}$\n\n$\\frac{3}{10}$ av klassen er gutter som spiller fotball."},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løs tekstoppgavene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4}$ av en pizza spises. Deretter spises $\\frac{2}{3}$ av det som er igjen. Hvor mye er igjen nå?","solution":"Igjen først: $\\frac{1}{4}$. Spist: $\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{1}{6}$. Igjen: $\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"1/12"},{"label":"b","task":"En tank er $\\frac{2}{3}$ full. Etter påfylling er den $\\frac{5}{6}$ full. Hvor mye ble fylt på?","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"}],"solution":"a) 1/12, b) 1/6","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Multipliser brøkene og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{7} \\cdot \\frac{7}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{14}{28} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{8} \\cdot \\frac{4}{15}$","solution":"$\\frac{20}{120} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{9}{10} \\cdot \\frac{5}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{45}{60} = \\frac{3}{4}$","answer":0.75},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{8} \\cdot \\frac{16}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{48}{72} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 1/2, b) 1/6, c) 3/4, d) 2/3","hints":["Forkort før du ganger for enklere regning"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Divider brøkene og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\div \\frac{6}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{5} \\cdot \\frac{7}{6} = \\frac{21}{30} = \\frac{7}{10}$","answer":0.7},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{8}{9} \\div \\frac{4}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{9} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{12} \\div \\frac{10}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{12} \\cdot \\frac{9}{10} = \\frac{45}{120} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} \\div \\frac{21}{16}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{8} \\cdot \\frac{16}{21} = \\frac{112}{168} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 7/10, b) 2/3, c) 3/8, d) 2/3","hints":["Husk: Divider = gang med omvendt brøk"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Finn fellesnevner og regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$","answer":0.5},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{10} + \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{7}{10}$","answer":0.7},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{12} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{12} - \\frac{4}{12} = \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{1}{4}$","answer":0.25}],"solution":"a) 1/2, b) 3/8, c) 7/10, d) 1/4","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut med flere brøker","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{6}{6} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{8} - \\frac{4}{8} + \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} + \\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} + \\frac{4}{6} - \\frac{3}{6} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$1 - \\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{20}{20} - \\frac{8}{20} - \\frac{5}{20} = \\frac{7}{20}$","answer":0.35}],"solution":"a) 1, b) 3/8, c) 1, d) 7/20","hints":["Finn minste felles nevner først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Forenkle de sammensatte brøkuttrykkene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}}{\\frac{9}{8}}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{9} = \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{7}{6}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{7}{6}}{\\frac{7}{6}} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{\\frac{10}{3}}$","solution":"$5 \\cdot \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{15}{10} = \\frac{3}{2}$","answer":1.5},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{3}{8}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{3}{8}} = \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot \\frac{8}{3} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 2/3, b) 1, c) 3/2, d) 2/3","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-10","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-10","number":"10","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Tekstoppgaver med brøker","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Kari har lest $\\frac{2}{5}$ av en bok som har 350 sider. Hvor mange sider har hun lest?","solution":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot 350 = \\frac{700}{5} = 140$ sider","answer":140},{"label":"b","task":"Ole brukte $\\frac{3}{4}$ time på mattelekser og $\\frac{1}{2}$ time på norsk. Hvor lang tid brukte han totalt?","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{5}{4} = 1\\frac{1}{4}$ time"},{"label":"c","task":"En pose inneholder 24 kuler. $\\frac{1}{3}$ er røde og $\\frac{1}{4}$ er blå. Hvor mange kuler er hverken røde eller blå?","solution":"Røde: $8$, Blå: $6$. Resten: $24 - 8 - 6 = 10$ kuler","answer":10}],"solution":"a) 140 sider, b) 1 1/4 time, c) 10 kuler","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-11","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-11","number":"11","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Kombinerte oppgaver","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"c","task":"$(\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}) \\cdot \\frac{6}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\cdot \\frac{6}{5} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div (\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4})$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{3}{4} = 1$","answer":1}],"solution":"a) 1, b) 2/3, c) 1, d) 1","hints":["Følg regnerekkefølgen: parenteser, gange/dele, pluss/minus"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-ex-12","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-ex-12","number":"12","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Utfordringsoppgaver","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Finn $x$ når $\\frac{x}{3} = \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$x = \\frac{2}{5} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{6}{5}$","answer":1.2},{"label":"b","task":"Finn $x$ når $\\frac{3}{x} = \\frac{9}{12}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{x} = \\frac{3}{4}$, så $x = 4$","answer":4},{"label":"c","task":"Hvilken brøk ligger midt mellom $\\frac{1}{4}$ og $\\frac{1}{2}$?","solution":"Gjennomsnitt: $\\frac{\\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{2}}{2} = \\frac{\\frac{3}{4}}{2} = \\frac{3}{8}$","answer":0.375},{"label":"d","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{1}{1 + \\frac{1}{2}}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{\\frac{3}{2}} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"}],"solution":"a) 6/5, b) 4, c) 3/8, d) 2/3","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-drofting","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"9-1-2-drofting-ex","number":"D1","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"**Drøftingsoppgave:** En pizza deles i 8 like stykker. Ali spiser $\\frac{3}{8}$ av pizzaen, og Bea spiser $\\frac{1}{4}$ av pizzaen. Ali sier at han spiste mer enn dobbelt så mye som Bea. Har Ali rett? Begrunn svaret med brøkregning. Hvor mye av pizzaen er igjen?","solution":"Bea spiste $\\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{2}{8}$. Ali spiste $\\frac{3}{8}$. Dobbelt av Beas andel: $2 \\cdot \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{4}{8}$. Siden $\\frac{3}{8} < \\frac{4}{8}$, spiste Ali IKKE mer enn dobbelt så mye. Han spiste $\\frac{3}{8} \\div \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{3}{2} = 1{,}5$ ganger så mye, altså halvannen gang så mye. Til sammen spiste de $\\frac{3}{8} + \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{5}{8}$. Det er $1 - \\frac{5}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$ igjen.","hints":["Gjør om $\\frac{1}{4}$ til åttendedeler for å sammenligne"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"9-1-2-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Multiplikasjon av brøker**: Gang teller med teller og nevner med nevner: $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$\n- **Divisjon av brøker**: Gang med den omvendte brøken: $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$\n- **Addisjon og subtraksjon av brøker**: Finn fellesnevner først, deretter adder eller subtraher tellerne\n- **Sammensatte brøkuttrykk**: Løs opp ved å beregne teller og nevner separat, og divider deretter\n- **Regnerekkefølge med brøker**: Parenteser, potenser, multiplikasjon/divisjon, addisjon/subtraksjon\n\n### Nøkkelbegreper\n| Begrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Teller | Tallet over brøkstreken |\n| Nevner | Tallet under brøkstreken |\n| Fellesnevner | Felles multiplum av nevnerne, nødvendig for addisjon/subtraksjon |\n| Omvendt brøk | Brøken snudd opp ned, brukes ved divisjon |\n| Forkorting | Dele teller og nevner på felles faktor |\n| Sammensatt brøk | Brøk der teller eller nevner også inneholder brøker |\n\n### Viktige formler\n- $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$\n- $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$\n- $\\frac{a}{c} + \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a+b}{c}$"},{"id":"9-1-2-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonTex